&control
  calculation='scf', prefix='NaCl_rs', outdir='./tmp',
  pseudo_dir='/Volumes/Aditya ssd/Salt-Battery-Lab/tools/pseudo/gbrv', tprnfor=.true., tstress=.true.,
  etot_conv_thr=1e-5, forc_conv_thr=1e-4, disk_io='low'
/
&system
  ibrav=0, nat=2, ntyp=2,
  ecutwfc=50, ecutrho=400, vdw_corr='dft-d3', dftd3_version=4,
  occupations='fixed',
/
&electrons
  conv_thr=1e-08, mixing_beta=0.3, electron_maxstep=200
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
Na 22.990 na_pbe_v1.5.uspp.F.UPF
Cl 35.453 cl_pbe_v1.4.uspp.F.UPF
CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
  0.00000000 2.82000000 2.82000000
  2.82000000 0.00000000 2.82000000
  2.82000000 2.82000000 0.00000000
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
Na 0.00000000 0.00000000 0.00000000
Cl 0.50000000 0.50000000 0.50000000
K_POINTS automatic
8 8 8 0 0 0
